    <sys:String x:Key="LOCSourceLogoOnDetailsViewDesc">Shows the game source logo on the details screen, such as Steam, Epic, GOG, or Xbox.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCSourceLogoOnMainScreenDesc">Shows a source badge at the top of the main view with the game source logo.</sys:String>
